    "recent_reform": "The Social Security Fairness Act was signed on January 5, 2025, repealing the Windfall Elimination Provision (WEP) and Government Pension Offset (GPO) and boosting benefits for over 2.8 million public servants. The 2025 Trustees Report projects the combined trust funds will be depleted in 2035, after which about 83% of benefits would still be payable.",
    "recent_reform_zh": "《社会保障公平法》于2025年1月5日签署，废除附带消除条款（WEP）与政府养老金抵消（GPO），使逾280万公职人员受益。2025年受托人报告预计合并信托基金将于2035年耗尽，此后仍可支付约83%的给付。"
